# App Store screenshots are deliberately NOT tracked: ~40 MB of PNGs that would
# sit in git history forever and never shrink out of it.
#
# They are reproducible instead:
#   seed.sh <sim-name> <light|dark>   seeds the sample notes into a fresh
#                                     simulator container and launches the app
#   xcrun simctl io <sim> screenshot out.png     captures a raw shot into raw/
#   make_marketing.py                 rebuilds every captioned composition in
#                                     marketing/ from whatever is in raw/
#
# Capture devices (sizes App Store Connect requires):
#   A2Z-Shot-iPhone  iPhone 17 Pro Max      1320x2868  (6.9")
#   A2Z-Shot-iPad    iPad Pro 13-inch M5    2064x2752  (13")
raw/
marketing/
